<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-CHAMPIONS TROPHY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-CHAMPIONS TROPHY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the round-robin league of the Champions Trophy hockey tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p>Holland beat Spain 4-0 (halftime 2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Holland - De Mooijer Teun 7, Jaap Buma Derk 26, Van Pelt Wouter 51 and Bram Lomans 60.</p>
</text>
